  "solution": "Theo đề ta có <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mn>1000</mn></mrow></semantics></math> và <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mn>2</mn><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mn>1000</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>25</mn><mi>%</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mn>1000</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>1250</mn></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>Từ <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mn>1000</mn></mrow></semantics></math> suy ra <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>P</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>⋅</mo><msup><mi>a</mi><mn>0</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>1000</mn><mo>⇒</mo><msub><mi>P</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>1000</mn></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>Từ <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mn>2</mn><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mn>1250</mn></mrow></semantics></math> suy ra <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>P</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>⋅</mo><msup><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>1250</mn><mo>⇒</mo><msup><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>5</mn><mn>4</mn></mfrac><mo>⇒</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><msqrt><mn>5</mn></msqrt><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>Vậy <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mn>1000</mn><mo>⋅</mo><msup><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><msqrt><mn>5</mn></msqrt><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mi>t</mi></msup></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>Số lượng vi khuẩn vượt gấp đôi số lượng ban đầu khi <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mn>1000</mn><mo>⋅</mo><msup><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><msqrt><mn>5</mn></msqrt><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mi>t</mi></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>⋅</mo><mn>1000</mn><mo>⇔</mo><msup><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><msqrt><mn>5</mn></msqrt><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mi>t</mi></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>⇒</mo><mi>t</mi><mo>≈</mo><mn>6</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>Vậy sau <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>6</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></semantics></math> ngày thì số lượng vi khuẩn vượt gấp đôi số lượng ban đầu.",
